{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2022-12", "window": 4, "start_date": 1671840000, "end_date": 1672531199, "month_true_total": 129, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:52:52 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "129805206", "author": {"steamid": "76561197961230031", "personaname": "Craid", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197961230031/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 6338, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4704, "last_played": 1732505352, "avatar": "8896fe2a855fbb58ff1950e505477baefe5744ca"}, "language": "english", "review": "Giant Ants, Spiders, and Aliens and you have a huge gun, what more could you want in life?", "timestamp_created": 1672520245, "timestamp_updated": 1672520245, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "129801430", "author": {"steamid": "76561198023836949", "personaname": "...", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198023836949/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 78, "playtime_forever": 2695, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 287, "last_played": 1780087575, "avatar": "84224eec0120d236897e8ef9f7bde37ae6155dc2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game if you want to turn off your brain and shoot anything that moves.\n\nNot hating on it, sometimes you just need a game that doesn't demand a lot of focus from you.\nTurn on your favourite music and just shoot the ♥♥♥♥ out of all of these alien ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥.\n\nWhile i have no clue about builds and what is good or not, it feels fun and also satisfying to let everything explode and watch the ragdolls fly all over the place.\n\nGraphics are really nothing to write home about but the game makes up for that with solid and smooth gameplay, some janky movements of enemies (so don't look too closely)\n\nOne thing that bothers me is that i can not jump to a side but dodge roll to it, so i get stuck on objects because i am trying to hop sideways but end up dodge rolling into it and therefore get killed xD\n\nAll in all\n\nGet it on sale and have fun with it and if you can bring some friends :D", "timestamp_created": 1672516289, "timestamp_updated": 1672516289, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "129786014", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992833126", "personaname": "Zyphin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zyphin/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 1601, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 916, "last_played": 1675401528, "avatar": "0cdf49e9838dcb03fcdca4ecb921423075907160"}, "language": "english", "review": "THE E D F DEPLOYS!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!", "timestamp_created": 1672501912, "timestamp_updated": 1672501912, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "129762572", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047112105", "personaname": "Democratic Puppygirl", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/394948052248428554/", "num_games_owned": 139, "num_reviews": 68, "playtime_forever": 7754, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at